# CODEOWNERS — Mandatory Review Assignments
#
# GitHub CODEOWNERS file. Owners listed here are automatically added as
# required reviewers when pull requests modify matching paths.
#
# Security rationale (MC-29, T-29, system-design.md §3.5):
#   Workflow files have access to repository secrets. A malicious or
#   accidental modification to a workflow file can exfiltrate secrets
#   (e.g., ANTHROPIC_API_KEY). Requiring CODEOWNERS approval prevents
#   unauthorized workflow modifications from merging without human review.
#
# OWASP CI/CD Top-10 C-09: Improperly secured artifact registries
# CIS GitHub Benchmark: Require code owners review for critical paths

# =============================================================================
# GitHub Actions Workflows — Require repository maintainer review
# =============================================================================
# ALL workflow files require approval due to secrets access (MC-29)
.github/workflows/               @geekatron

# All composite actions (have access to secrets via caller context)
.github/actions/                 @geekatron

# =============================================================================
# Prompt Regression Pipeline — Require additional review
# =============================================================================
# Statistical engine and test harness: changes affect all regression verdicts
jerry/testing/                   @geekatron
tests/prompt-regression/         @geekatron

# Baseline data: changes affect all future regression comparisons (MC-22, MC-23)
baselines/                       @geekatron

# Behavioral contracts: changes affect MR coverage computation (FR-013)
contracts/                       @geekatron

# =============================================================================
# Agent definitions — Any modification triggers prompt regression pipeline
# =============================================================================
skills/*/agents/*.md             @geekatron

# =============================================================================
# Jerry framework governance — Highest criticality (AE-001 through AE-004)
# =============================================================================
docs/governance/                 @geekatron
.context/rules/                  @geekatron
CLAUDE.md                        @geekatron
